Model
================================================================================

  Decider 2B            licence unverified and terms of use unverified,
                        verification pending

Decider 2B is the only model diagnostic-tool selector in this project. Its
checkpoint is operator-supplied and is not vendored, redistributed, or pinned
here: the runtime records whichever revision the operator configures. Its
licence, its terms of use, and whether those terms permit the use this project
makes of it are all unverified.

